# mayhem/lci/lci.dict -- LOLCODE keyword dictionary for the lci libFuzzer target.
#
# libFuzzer dictionary entries; tokens taken from lci's own tokenizer.h keyword table
# (TT_* enum) and the upstream test/ corpus. One multi-word keyword phrase per line so
# the fuzzer can splice whole tokens the lexer/tokenizer/parser recognize, rather than
# reassembling them byte-by-byte.
